 the supply of safe and high-quality blood, plasma and other biological products, bolstering the capacity to respond to emergencies, support medical treatments, and improve patient and community outcomes.  - First Nations Centrality: our work is informed by the voices of First Nations people, so that we may work together in the purpose of Australian Red Cross, while fostering cultural safety, equity and greater inclusion of First Nations people in our programs, volunteering and as voices of advocacy.   For more information on our activities, see    https:\/\/www.redcross.org.au\/about\/what-we-do\/","OperatingInStates":[{"Name":"Victoria","uuid":"4ea3219c-455e-e811-a95c-000d3ad1c715"},{"Name":"Tasmania","uuid":"4fa3219c-455e-e811-a95c-000d3ad1c715"},{"Name":"New South Wales","uuid":"2bf593a5-455e-e811-a95c-000d3ad1c715"},{"Name":"Queensland","uuid":"2cf593a5-455e-e811-a95c-000d3ad1c715"},{"Name":"Western Australia","uuid":"dc2782ae-455e-e811-a95c-000d3ad1c715"},{"Name":"South Australia","uuid":"dd2782ae-455e-e811-a95c-000d3ad1c715"},{"Name":"Australian Capital Territory","uuid":"db77d9b9-455e-e811-a95c-000d3ad1c715"},{"Name":"Northern Territory","uuid":"dd77d9b9-455e-e811-a95c-000d3ad1c715"}],"TotalGrossIncomeGovernmentGrants":"935303000","TotalGrossIncomeOtherRevenues":"32220000","TotalGrossIncomeDonationsAndRequests":"76517000","TotalGrossIncomeGoodsOrServices":"49644000","TotalGrossIncomeInvestments":"17086000","TotalExpensesGrantsAndDonationsInAustralia":"136508506","TotalExpensesGrantsAndDonationsOutsideAustralia":"26652542","TotalExpensesInterest":"11863000","TotalExpensesOther":"384596952","TotalExpensesEmployee":"591599000","ChooseToProvideAis":null,"AnnualReports":[{"type":"Financial Report 2019","Year":"2019","IsAIS":false,"DueDate":"2020-01-31T00:00:00.0000000Z","DateReceived":"2019-12-16T05:41:45.0000000Z","AISId":null,"Status":"Submitted","DocumentUuid":"faf950b5-c61f-ea11-a810-000d3ad1cf4f","uuid":"683c7f33-e925-e911-a976-000d3ad02a61"},{"type":"Annual